+  // Cadence split: the OCCUPIED cloud is small (tens of thousands of points)
+  // and safety-critical downstream, so it goes out every cycle; the FREE and
+  // UNKNOWN clouds grow with the explored volume (hundreds of thousands to
+  // millions of points serialized at 2 Hz) and only support visualisation and
+  // slow ghost-clearing, so they go out every 10th cycle. Without this the
